# === Operator-useful carve-outs (negation rules; must come AFTER the deny rules) ===
# These override the explicit per-subdir/per-file deny rules above via
# gitignore "last matching pattern wins" semantics.

# Top-level docs (CLAUDE.md-referenced operator memory + reference)
!/ComfyUI/AGENTS.md
!/ComfyUI/README.md
!/ComfyUI/MASTER_REFERENCE.md
!/ComfyUI/MASTER_PLAN.md
!/ComfyUI/MODEL_DASHBOARD.md
!/ComfyUI/COMFYUI_QUICK_START.md
!/ComfyUI/COMFYUI_SYSTEM_INDEX.md
!/ComfyUI/QUANTIZATION.md
!/ComfyUI/USAGE_GUIDE.md

# CLAUDE.md-referenced launchers (operator)
!/ComfyUI/launch_music_video_studio.bat
!/ComfyUI/launch_comfyui_menu.bat

# Operator-useful tools/ scripts (CLAUDE.md + operator-discoverable)
!/ComfyUI/tools/check_gpu_stack.bat
!/ComfyUI/tools/configure_remote_stay_connected.bat
!/ComfyUI/tools/fix_pagefile.bat
!/ComfyUI/tools/fix_pagefile.ps1
!/ComfyUI/tools/free_model_switch.bat
!/ComfyUI/tools/free_model_switch.ps1
!/ComfyUI/tools/local_ai_assistant.bat
